part rec_joint
  tally 2
  note "Bank Jodła, the joint account LN27 … 0001 (records/jodla-wspolny.csv), every row as it stands: dr is what went out, cr what came in, bal the balance after it, k the importer classification of its type, counterparty and title (data), m the month its title names. Rows of a day are numbered in the file order (seq). The account is seen live: each row is known on its day; each month is listed whole, known at its end (the none rows)."

version jodla_joint
  cite jodla_wspolny
  governs always
  known 2024-01-01
